\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer." 13194139535417 true] [17592186348175 1113 #uuid "b2987e81-f85b-5262-9ea2-835ea44d86e0" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348175 1145 "To find the domain of $f$, we need the intersection of the domains of the individual components.\n\n- The domain of the 1st component $t+1$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the 2nd component $\\operatorname{tan}⁡(3t)$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ except for the values of $t$ for which\n\n$$\n3t=\\frac{\\pi }{2}+\\pi n\\,⟹\\,t=\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{\\pi n}{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer.\n\n- The domain of the 3rd component ${e}^{-t}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{\\pi n}{3},\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer." 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348177 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348178 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348179 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348180 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1000 #edb/ref 17592186348181 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1041 "selection" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1104 #edb/ref 17592186348177 13194139535417 true] [17592186348176 1110 #uuid "5ef4e86f-865e-5090-ad52-6a1a01a7ae04" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348177 1034 "\\frac{\\pi }{6}+\\frac{\\pi n}{3}" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348177 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535417 true] [17592186348177 1111 #uuid "9bc502d3-9a60-5405-a2ed-1dbed2532bc0" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348178 1034 "\\frac{\\pi n}{6}" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348178 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535417 true] [17592186348178 1111 #uuid "c2209042-3cbe-552c-92a8-70ade799ba0a" 13194139535417 true] [17592186348179 1034 "3\\pi n" 13194139535417 t